<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Hotel Accommodation Confirmation Letter</title>
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            line-height: 1.6;
            font-size: 12px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
        }
        thead { display: table-header-group; }
        tfoot { display: table-footer-group; }
        tr { page-break-inside: avoid; }

        .header {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }
        .logo {
            width: 315px;
            height: auto;
        }
        .title {
            font-size: 18px;
            font-weight: bold;
            text-align: right;
        }
        table {
            width: 100%;
            border-collapse: collapse;
        }
        table, th, td {
            border: none;
        }
        th, td {
            padding: 5px;
            text-align: left;
        }
        .subject {
            font-weight: bold;
            margin: 20px 0;
        }
        .footer {
            margin-top: 20px;
        }

        main { text-transform: uppercase; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="header">
        <img src="data:image/png;base64,<%= logoBase64 %>" alt="Logo Company" class="logo">
        <!-- <img src="<%= logoBase64 %>" alt="Hotels Logo" class="logo "> -.
        <div class="title">Hotel Accommodation Confirmation Letter</div>
    </div>

    <table>
        <tr>
            <td>Date</td>
            <td>: <%= date %></td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
            <td>To</td>
            <td>: <%= to %></td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
            <td>Company</td>
            <td>: <%= company %></td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
            <td>Telephone</td>
            <td>: <%= telephone %></td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
            <td>Email</td>
            <td>: <%= email %></td>
        </tr>
    </table>

    <div class="subject">Subject: Hotel Accommodation Confirmation Letter</div>

    <p>Dear <%= to %>,</p>

    <p>Greetings from <%= hotelName %>...</p>

    <p>We are pleased to confirm the following room reservation as follows:</p>

    <table>
        <tr>
            <td>Reservation Number:</td>
            <td>: <%= reservationNumber %></td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
            <td>Arrival Date:</td>
            <td>: <%= arrivalDate %></td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
            <td>Departure Date:</td>
            <td>: <%= departureDate %></td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
            <td>Total Nights:</td>
            <td>: <%= totalNights %></td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
            <td>Room Type:</td>
            <td>: <%= roomType %></td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
            <td>Daily Rate:</td>
            <td>: Rp. <%= dailyRate %></td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
            <td>Room rate Notes:</td>
            <td>: <%= roomRateNotes %></td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
            <td>Method of Payment :</td>
            <td>: <%= methodOfPayment %></td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
            <td>Total Charge:</td>
            <td>: <%= totalCharge %></td>
        </tr>
    </table>

    <p>We will hold your reservation until 18:00hrs on the date of the arrival and will be automatically released without prior notice, unless guaranteed by cash, credit card, letter of guarantee or bank transfer to:</p>

    <p>
        PT FANTASTIK ASIA INTERNASIONAL<br>
        Bank Mandiri Cabang Grand Niaga Mas<br>
        Acct No. 109-00-2909788-8
    </p>

    <p>If your reservation guaranteed and the guest does not show up, we have the rights to charge 1 night for the no show fee. As your reservation confirmed, kindly signed this letter and returned to us by email: reservation@asialinkhotel.com</p>

    <p>Please be informed our standard check-in time is 14:00hrs and check-out time is 12:00hrs Our staff will be at your service and we look forward to welcoming you or your guest soon.</p>

    <div class="footer">
        <table>
            <tr>
                <td>
                    Best Regards,<br><br><br>
                    RAFIKA<br>
                    FRONT OFFICE
                </td>
                <td>
                    Acknowledged & Accepted by:<br><br><br>
                    ________________________<br>
                    (Company Stamp & Sign)
                </td>
            </tr>
        </table>
    </div>

    <div style="text-align: center; margin-top: 20px;">
        <%= hotelName %><br>
        <%= hotelContact %>
    </div>
</body>
</html>